    "commit_message": "feat(memory): Stream 6 validation benchmark + combined knowledge record\n\nPrivate LoCoMo-style eval (scripts/memory/benchmark_locomo.py) \u2014 the\nmission's own stated acceptance gate for Streams 3-5, not a nice-to-have.\nSince the Stream 5 nightly job's trailing-24h window will never touch\nthe mission's real historical Command Memory (65 rows, oldest\n2026-06-14), this benchmark does its own one-time seed step to get a\nreal number today.\n\nActual run, sample=8 real decisions: Graphiti retrieval post-seed hit\n62.5% (5/8, simple token-overlap scoring); the pre-existing COMMAND\nrecall route hit 0% (0/8) \u2014 not a modeling artifact, a confirmed finding\nthat unified_memory._recall_table() only supports exact-match filters\nand has no natural-language recall capability at all.\n\nCombined knowledge record covers Streams 1/3/4/5/6 together (one\ndependent consolidation arc, per the mission's Reporting instruction \u2014\nStream 2 already has its own separate record as the standalone piece).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BoYPKyEGaDvpHkxjdGxsC4",
